# State and effects

| Concern | Owner |
| --- | --- |
| Durable data | `@context` value, typically a SQLite connection |
| Startup | `@init` (failure exits the process) |
| Per-request I/O | `@method:role` handler bodies |
| Markup | `@component` (pure) |

The browser does not own the domain model. Datastar morphs HTML or applies
JSON as signals. Putting authoritative counts in `$count` fights that split.

**Related:** [Why Roc](/docs/concepts/why-roc/).
